# JavaScript / Node
# NOTE: no trailing slash — a `foo/` rule matches a DIRECTORY only, so it
# SILENTLY STOPS applying if the path becomes a symlink (the standard
# ~/.agent-worktrees recipe symlinks node_modules), letting `git add -A` sweep
# a mode-120000 blob into the tree and damage the shared checkout at MERGE time.
# Bare `node_modules` matches a dir, file, OR symlink. (cortex, disc #300)
node_modules
custom_components/dynamic_map/frontend/node_modules
.vitest/
.coverage/

